#  P A R T I C L E   S O U R C E
#=====================================================

#/gate/source/addSource                                                              HoffmanBrainSource_Brainweb voxel
#/gate/source/HoffmanBrainSource_Brainweb/reader/insert                              image
#/gate/source/HoffmanBrainSource_Brainweb/imageReader/translator/insert              range
